{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05371","headline":"奉和御制平胡 · 裴漼","name":"奉和御制平胡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄漠圣恩通，由来书轨同。\n忽闻窥月满，相聚寇云中。\n庙略占黄气，神兵出绦宫。\n将军行逐虏，使者亦和戎。\n一举轒輼灭，再麾沙漠空。\n直将威禁暴，非用武爲雄。\n饮至明军礼，醻勳锡武功。\n干戈还载戢，文德在唐风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴漼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}